{"ref":"character:megalo-elizabeth-bartley","lead":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Animated-Alucard.gif","w":40,"h":34}]},{"k":"p","c":["DLC Content (Ode to Castlevania)"]},{"k":"p","c":["This article primarily features content only available in DLC, which may not be available in all copies of the game."]},{"k":"p","c":["Megalo Elizabeth Bartley is a secret playable character from the Ode to Castlevania DLC of Vampire Survivors. Her starting weapon is the ",{"i":"Sprite-Belnades'_Spellbook.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:belnades-spellbook"}," ",{"t":"Belnades' Spellbook","r":"weapon:belnades-spellbook"},", but she also has the option of starting with the ",{"i":"Sprite-Ebony_Diabologue.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:ebony-diabologue"}," ",{"t":"Ebony Diabologue","r":"weapon:ebony-diabologue"}," if it has been unlocked."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Character","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["31 October 2024 (Update)"]]},{"label":"Alias","cells":[["Elizabeth"]]},{"label":"Character ID","cells":[["TP_ELIZABETH_MEGA"]]},{"label":"Skin ID","cells":[["DEFAULT"]]},{"label":"Controller","cells":[["TP_MegaloElizabeth_Character"]]},{"label":"Starting weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Belnades'_Spellbook.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"weapon:belnades-spellbook"}," ",{"t":"Belnades' Spellbook","r":"weapon:belnades-spellbook"}]]},{"label":"Unlocked by","cells":[["Ravage everything and everyone in Dracula's Castle while in her demonic form."]]},{"label":"Cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 16,650"]]},{"label":"Secret","cells":[["Yes"]]},{"label":"Ignores walls","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Theme","cells":[[{"i":"Music-Ode_to_Castlevania-Evelyn_Lark.png","w":20,"h":20}," \"Reincarnated Soul - Vampire Survivors\""]]}]},{"title":"Initial stats","rows":[{"label":"Max Health","cells":[["400"]]},{"label":"Armor","cells":[["+2"]]},{"label":"Move Speed","cells":[["+50%"]]},{"label":"Might","cells":[["+250%"]]},{"label":"Cooldown","cells":[["-20%"]]},{"label":"Greed","cells":[["+100%"]]},{"label":"Reroll","cells":[["+10"]]},{"label":"Skip","cells":[["+10"]]},{"label":"Banish","cells":[["+10"]]},{"label":"Charm","cells":[["50"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":21,"h":21,"a":"A sprite icon representing Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane linking to Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," \"Ravage everything and everyone in Dracula's Castle while in her demonic form.\"\nFull unlock method hidden. Click \"Show Details\" to unhide."]},{"k":"p","c":["After obtaining both the ",{"i":"Sprite-Ebony_and_Crimson_Stones.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"relic:ebony-and-crimson-stones"}," ",{"t":"Ebony and Crimson Stones","r":"relic:ebony-and-crimson-stones"}," and the ",{"i":"Sprite-Pile_of_Secrets.png","w":20,"h":24,"r":"relic:pile-of-secrets"}," ",{"t":"Pile of Secrets","r":"relic:pile-of-secrets"},", the player must start a run in ",{"t":"Ode to Castlevania","r":"stage:ode-to-castlevania-stage"}," while playing as ",{"i":"Sprite-Elizabeth_Bartley.png","w":20,"h":24,"r":"character:elizabeth-bartley"}," ",{"t":"Elizabeth Bartley","r":"character:elizabeth-bartley"}," and kill a total of 100,000 enemies or more in a single run. Doing this unlocks Megalo Elizabeth Bartley as a playable character."]},{"k":"p","c":["Once unlocked, Megalo Elizabeth Bartley can be purchased for ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 16,650, which scales with other characters purchased."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Megalo Elizabeth Bartley can be unlocked in the ",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"petrifyinglyevil\"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Megalo Elizabeth Bartley starts with the following bonuses:"]},{"k":"ul","items"